before	<col=800000>The ability to defeat a level 120 Black Knight Titan</col>
step	1	1	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>King Arthur</col> sent me on a quest to find the <col=800000>Holy Grail</col>. I should ask <col=800000>Merlin</col> where to begin.</col>
step	2	2	After speaking to Merlin
line	<str>King Arthur sent me on a quest to find the Holy Grail.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Merlin</col> told me to speak to <col=800000>Galahad</col>, and to visit the island of <col=800000>Entrana</col>. I should speak to the <col=800000>High Priest</col> of Entrana.</col>
step	3	3	After speaking to the High Priest
line	<str>King Arthur sent me on a quest to find the Holy Grail.</str>
line	<str>Merlin told me to speak to Galahad, and to visit the island of Entrana.</str>
line	<col=000080>The <col=800000>High Priest</col> of <col=800000>Entrana</col> told me of the <col=800000>Fisher King</col> and his realm. I should find <col=800000>Galahad</col>, who lives west of <col=800000>McGrubor's Wood</col>.</col>
step	4	4	After speaking to Galahad
line	<str>King Arthur sent me on a quest to find the Holy Grail.</str>
line	<str>Merlin told me to speak to Galahad, and to visit the island of Entrana.</str>
line	<str>The High Priest of Entrana told me of the Fisher King and his realm.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Galahad</col> gave me his <col=800000>Holy table napkin</col>. The magic whistles lie on a table on the top floor of <col=800000>Draynor Manor</col>. I should blow a whistle between the pillars in <col=800000>Brimhaven</col> to reach the <col=800000>Fisher Realm</col>.</col>
step	5	5	After defeating the Titan
line	<str>King Arthur sent me on a quest to find the Holy Grail.</str>
line	<str>Merlin told me to speak to Galahad, and to visit the island of Entrana.</str>
line	<str>The High Priest of Entrana told me of the Fisher King and his realm.</str>
line	<str>Galahad gave me his Holy table napkin. The magic whistles lie on a table on the top floor of Draynor Manor.</str>
line	<col=000080>I entered the <col=800000>Fisher Realm</col> and defeated the <col=800000>Black Knight Titan</col> with <col=800000>Excalibur</col>. The castle's broken bricks hide a bell that might let me in.</col>
step	6	6	After speaking to the Fisher King
line	<str>King Arthur sent me on a quest to find the Holy Grail.</str>
line	<str>Merlin told me to speak to Galahad, and to visit the island of Entrana.</str>
line	<str>The High Priest of Entrana told me of the Fisher King and his realm.</str>
line	<str>Galahad gave me his Holy table napkin. The magic whistles lie on a table on the top floor of Draynor Manor.</str>
line	<str>I entered the Fisher Realm and defeated the Black Knight Titan with Excalibur.</str>
line	<col=000080>The <col=800000>Fisher King</col> asked me to find his son. <col=800000>King Arthur</col> may have something that can help.</col>
step	7	7	After getting the feather
line	<str>King Arthur sent me on a quest to find the Holy Grail.</str>
line	<str>Merlin told me to speak to Galahad, and to visit the island of Entrana.</str>
line	<str>The High Priest of Entrana told me of the Fisher King and his realm.</str>
line	<str>Galahad gave me his Holy table napkin. The magic whistles lie on a table on the top floor of Draynor Manor.</str>
line	<str>I entered the Fisher Realm and defeated the Black Knight Titan with Excalibur.</str>
line	<str>The Fisher King asked me to find his son.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>King Arthur</col> gave me a <col=800000>Magic gold feather</col>, which pointed towards the sacks in <col=800000>Goblin Village</col>. I should search there.</col>
step	8	8	After finding Percival
line	<str>King Arthur sent me on a quest to find the Holy Grail.</str>
