line	<str>The Fisher King asked me to find his son.</str>
line	<str>King Arthur gave me a Magic gold feather, which pointed towards the sacks in Goblin Village.</str>
line	<col=000080>I found <col=800000>Sir Percival</col> in <col=800000>Goblin Village</col> and gave him a whistle so that he could go home. The <col=800000>Fisher Realm</col> has been restored. I should take the <col=800000>Holy Grail</col> from the eastern tower back to <col=800000>King Arthur</col>.</col>
